{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Nemesis</strong>\u00a0<strong>Demo</strong> is a 7-level free preview of an upcoming high-definition, hypnotic-electro-infused arcade shooter that fuses old-school flair with modern polish. Take control of Earth\u2019s last experimental starfighter and battle through the Solar System, from the scarred Moon to the red wastes of Mars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect tight, satisfying combat, a weapon upgrade system, and visuals that hit like a synthwave fever dream. Every level is handcrafted with distinct biomes, pulsing soundtracks, and escalating enemy patterns that demand reflexes <i>and</i> strategy. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro vibes, modern look\u00a0and\u00a0feel\u00a0</strong>- Smooth controls, dynamic enemy waves, and layered challenge that rewards mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nemesis Mode</strong>\u00a0- Flawless performance unlocks deadlier versions of each level with higher risks -and greater rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your arsenal</strong>\u00a0- Earn currency by surviving and excelling, then upgrade your weapons to meet new challanges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Earth to the stars</strong> \u2013 Battle across the Solar System in the demo version, beyond in the full release,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Dive into a hypnotic blend of electronic, retro, and a dash of metal tracks to put you 'in the zone'.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042210?t=1759434134","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042210?t=1759434134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042210/71eeac04fbe6a08298bc1d00615750ac08249a54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759434134","capsule_imagev5":"